    </div>

    <div class="barnacle-feature-row">
      <div class="barnacle-feature-img">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0701/8437/0218/t/3/assets/YETIFINALNOLOGO.webp?v=1774008226" alt="Yeti tumbler in The Barnacle on the water" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="barnacle-feature-text">
        <div class="barnacle-ft-eyebrow">On The Water</div>
        <h3 class="barnacle-ft-title">Your drink's new best friend.</h3>
        <p class="barnacle-ft-body">Whether you're out on the open water or docked at the marina, The Barnacle keeps your tumbler locked in place — even when the waves say otherwise.</p>
        <div class="barnacle-feat-pill">⚓ Boat-tested, water-approved</div>
