      </div>
      <div class="barnacle-feature-text">
        <div class="barnacle-ft-eyebrow">On The Go</div>
        <h3 class="barnacle-ft-title">Portable. Grippy. Zero excuses.</h3>
        <p class="barnacle-ft-body">Cooler lid, tailgate rail, truck bed, kayak deck — if it's flat, The Barnacle owns it. Toss it in your bag and forget it's there until you need it most.</p>
        <div class="barnacle-feat-pill">🏕️ Trail-ready, tailgate-approved</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="barnacle-feature-row">
      <div class="barnacle-feature-img">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0701/8437/0218/t/3/assets/modelo-boat.webp?v=1774008257" alt="Bottle in The Barnacle on a boat" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="barnacle-feature-text">
        <div class="barnacle-ft-eyebrow">Bottles Too</div>
        <h3 class="barnacle-ft-title">Cans, bottles, tumblers — all of them.</h3>
        <p class="barnacle-ft-body">The Barnacle's adaptive grip cradles everything from a standard 12 oz can to a wide-mouth bottle. One holder. Every drink. Every adventure.</p>
        <div class="barnacle-feat-pill">🍺 Fits virtually any vessel</div>
